  "_saved": "2026-08-07, captured from the live studio panel",
  "_status": "PARTIALLY WIRED. app/components/HeroDroneScene.tsx reads this file for lighting, spotlight, sequence, camera, materials, boards and beats. public/models/od3/_studio.html (the tuning studio) still hardcodes the same values and does NOT read this file: tune there, then copy the numbers here.",
  "scroll": {
    "_note": "Weight comes from springHz: it is a critically damped spring, so a lower frequency reads as more mass. gain sets how far one notch of wheel pushes the target, commitAt how much of a stop-to-stop move a gesture must cover before it counts as intent to advance.",
    "springHz": 0.38,
    "gain": 0.0013,
    "magnet": 0.11,
